---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Corrections"
  description="How to report a ControlCurrent catalogue, calculation, or source interpretation problem."
>
  <header class="shell page-header">
    <span class="eyebrow">Corrections</span>
    <h1>Challenge the mapping, not the evidence trail</h1>
    <p>
      Reports should identify the control, browser baseline, BCD path and package version, expected
      result, and a primary specification or source supporting the correction.
    </p>
  </header>
  <article class="shell prose">
    <h2>Report a project issue</h2>
    <p>
      Use the repository issue tracker for catalogue mappings, calculations, wording, accessibility,
      or reproducibility. Do not include private application details or security vulnerabilities in
      a public issue.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="https://github.com/slicedearth/controlcurrent/issues" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Open the ControlCurrent issue tracker
      </a>
    </p>

    <h2>Report source data</h2>
    <p>
      A BCD support-data problem should also be reported through the MDN Browser Compatibility Data
      contribution process. ControlCurrent will not silently override source evidence with an
      undocumented local claim.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Open the MDN BCD issue tracker
      </a>
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
